{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51700","headline":"刺贾岛 · 张蠙","name":"刺贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年爲理但公清，鸿渐行中是去程。\n莫恨长江爲短簿，可能胜得贾先生？\n（《监诫录》八《贾忤旨》）（〖1〗《监诫录》云：「後有一少年除长江簿，犹豫不赴，张蠙先辈爲诗刺之。\n」此处所拟诗题不允，应作「刺少年」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}